{"seq":2,"slug":"query-rewrite-expand","title":"查询改写、补全与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecommerce-query-understanding/spelling-rewrite/query-rewrite-expand","wordCount":2536,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询改写-补全与扩展\">查询改写、补全与扩展</h1><p>用户输入「小米电视」时，他脑子里想的具体商品可能是「小米电视 A55 55 英寸 4K」，但输入框里只有四个字。搜索引擎如果严格按这四个字去匹配，会漏掉大量只在标题里写了型号与尺寸的商品。查询改写要解决的正是这类「用户说得太少」的问题——在不改变意图的前提下，把短 query 扩成更接近索引词汇的形式。</p>\n<p>必须先把边界划线：纠错处理的是「用户说错了」，改写处理的是「用户说得对但不够」。二者是独立模块，因为判据完全不同——纠错看的是词形是否合法，改写看的是召回是否充足。混在一个模块里会导致改写被误纠错的护栏拦住，或纠错被改写的激进策略带偏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-改写是在查询空间里的受约束搜索\">核心概念：改写是在查询空间里的受约束搜索</h2><p>形式化地看，改写是寻找一个查询集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q&#x27; = \\{q_1, q_2, \\dots, q_k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，使得它召回的商品集合既覆盖原 query 的意图，又比原 query 的召回更充分。目标函数可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>Recall</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>∣</mo><mtext>intent</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Drift</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{Q&#x27;} \\; \\text{Recall}(Q&#x27; \\mid \\text{intent}(q)) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\text{Drift}(Q&#x27;, q) \\le \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6823em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">intent</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Drift</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在约束项。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Drift</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Drift}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Drift</span></span></span></span></span></span> 度量扩写后的意图偏移，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的漂移上限。没有这个约束，任何改写都可以通过「把 query 扩成热门词」来虚增召回，这是这类系统最常见的退化方式。</p>\n<p>改写与扩展在工程上通常分成四类动作，它们的风险与收益完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>输入示例</th>\n<th>输出示例</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>补全</td>\n<td><code>小米电视</code></td>\n<td><code>小米电视 A55 55英寸</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>提升精确匹配召回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同义替换</td>\n<td><code>手机壳</code></td>\n<td><code>保护壳 手机套</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>打通词汇多样性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概念扩展</td>\n<td><code>露营灯</code></td>\n<td><code>营地灯 帐篷灯 野营照明</code></td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>覆盖类目同义词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性补全</td>\n<td><code>羽绒服 女</code></td>\n<td><code>羽绒服 女 加厚 中长款</code></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>提升筛选式召回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四类的风险递增，因为越往后越依赖「猜用户想要什么」。工程实践上，越是高风险的动作越应当只在召回不足时才触发——这是后面「触发条件」一节的核心内容。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[原始 Query] --&gt; A{召回是否充足?}&#10;  A --&gt;|充足| S[不改写&lt;br/&gt;或仅同义替换]&#10;  A --&gt;|不足| B[改写触发]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[补全候选&lt;br/&gt;点击共现日志]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[同义替换&lt;br/&gt;同义词词典]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[概念扩展&lt;br/&gt;类目词表/向量近邻]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[漂移护栏打分]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| E[合并去重&lt;br/&gt;生成候选集]&#10;  D --&gt;|拒绝| S&#10;  E --&gt; F[下游召回多路执行]\">graph TD\n  Q[原始 Query] --&gt; A{召回是否充足?}\n  A --&gt;|充足| S[不改写&lt;br/&gt;或仅同义替换]\n  A --&gt;|不足| B[改写触发]\n  B --&gt; C1[补全候选&lt;br/&gt;点击共现日志]\n  B --&gt; C2[同义替换&lt;br/&gt;同义词词典]\n  B --&gt; C3[概念扩展&lt;br/&gt;类目词表/向量近邻]\n  C1 --&gt; D[漂移护栏打分]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|通过| E[合并去重&lt;br/&gt;生成候选集]\n  D --&gt;|拒绝| S\n  E --&gt; F[下游召回多路执行]</pre><h2 id=\"补全-从点击共现里学-用户真正想要什么\">补全：从点击共现里学「用户真正想要什么」</h2><p>补全的最可靠信号来源是<strong>点击共现日志</strong>。逻辑很直接：如果大量用户搜「小米电视」时点击的商品标题都含有「A55」和「55英寸」，那么这些词就是这条 query 的有效扩展词。</p>\n<p>具体做法是构建「query → 点击商品标题词」的共现矩阵，用统计量筛选扩展词。常用的打分是点互信息或其变体：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PMI</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PMI}(w, q) = \\log \\frac{P(w, q)}{P(w) P(q)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PMI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直接用 PMI 会偏向低频词（冷门词与 query 的共现会显得「意外地高」），因此实践中更多用<strong>似然比或归一化后的条件概率</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(w \\mid q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 高且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本身有一定频次，才是好扩展词。</p>\n<p>补全的最大工程陷阱是<strong>自我强化的反馈回路</strong>。如果扩展词从点击日志学来，而点击又受当前排序影响，那么已有的排序偏好会被不断放大，形成「富者愈富」。缓解手段包括：用探索流量（randomized ranking 的一小部分流量）获取无偏共现数据；对扩展词做时间衰减，避免陈旧的共现长期主导；定期用无偏的交换实验数据校准。</p>\n<p>补全的另一个约束是<strong>扩展词数必须受限</strong>。扩展词越多，召回集合越大但精确率越低。典型做法是限制在 3–8 个扩展词，且要求扩展词之间相互不冲突（不能同时扩展成两个互斥的类目词）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同义替换与概念扩展-词典-向量与规则\">同义替换与概念扩展：词典、向量与规则</h2><p>同义替换与概念扩展的差别在于语义距离。同义替换是「等价的另一种说法」（<code>手机壳</code> ↔ <code>保护壳</code>），概念扩展是「同一概念下的不同具体物」（<code>露营灯</code> → <code>营地灯</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>词典路线</strong>是最可控的。维护一张按类目与语言分组的同义词表，表项来自三处：类目属性体系里已有的同义词定义、人工标注、以及从向量近邻里挖掘并人工确认的候选。词典的优势是精确、可审计、可热修；劣势是需要持续维护，且覆盖不了新出现的表达。</p>\n<p><strong>向量路线</strong>提供覆盖率。把 query 与索引词汇编码到同一向量空间，用近邻检索找出语义相近的词作为扩展候选。这条路线在 2023 年之后的实践里因为多语言编码器与对比学习的成熟而变得实用。它的核心问题是<strong>近邻不总是同义</strong>——向量近邻里会混入上下位词（<code>手机</code> 的近邻含 <code>手机壳</code>）、相关但不等价的词（<code>iPhone</code> 的近邻含 <code>Samsung</code>）。因此向量候选必须经过二次过滤：用类目一致性检查（扩展词与原 query 的预测类目是否一致）以及共现统计（两词在商品标题里是否可互换）来筛。</p>\n<p><strong>规则路线</strong>处理结构化扩展：类目词的上下位关系（<code>跑鞋</code> → <code>跑步鞋 运动鞋</code>）、品牌与系列的包含关系、以及市场特定的等价表达。规则的价值在于它可以精确表达「这个扩展在本市场成立」，而统计方法只能给出概率。</p>\n<p>三条路线在实践中是<strong>级联</strong>的：先查词典（高置信直接采用），词典未命中时用向量找候选，候选再过共现与类目过滤，最后用规则补充结构化扩展。</p>\n<p>跨境场景给同义替换带来一个特别的问题：<strong>跨语言同义</strong>。用户用英语搜 <code>earbuds</code>，但该市场大量商品标题用本地语写。此时「同义替换」实际上跨越了语言边界，需要走翻译式或嵌入式跨语言检索，属于跨境电商搜索里另一个独立的技术方向。本 hub 只处理同一语言内的同义与概念扩展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触发条件-什么时候不该改写\">触发条件：什么时候不该改写</h2><p>这是本篇最容易被忽略、也最容易出事的部分。改写不是默认行为，它应当由「召唤不足」触发。可用的触发信号有三类：</p>\n<p><strong>第一类：召回结果数过低。</strong> 原 query 的召回结果数低于阈值（如少于 20 个商品）时触发改写。这是最直接的信号，因为它就是问题的定义。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类：历史会话中的改写行为。</strong> 如果大量用户在搜完某 query 后立即改写成另一条 query 并成功点击，说明原 query 的表达与索引不匹配。这类「会话内改写」本身就是改写词典的天然来源——用户已经替系统完成了改写，只需要挖掘。</p>\n<p><strong>第三类：意图与类目置信度足够高。</strong> 改写要有依据才敢扩，依据就是第一章的输出。意图不明或类目预测置信度低的 query，改写只会放大错误。这也是为什么本篇排在 <a href=\"../intent-taxonomy/query-intent-classification\">交易/导航/评测等意图分类</a> 与 <a href=\"../intent-taxonomy/category-prediction\">品类预测与类目直达</a> 之后。</p>\n<p>反过来，有几类 query <strong>禁止改写</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>含精确型号或 SKU 的 query。型号是强约束，扩写会破坏精确匹配。</li>\n<li>品牌名单独出现。<code>Nike</code> 扩成 <code>Nike 运动鞋 跑步鞋</code> 会污染品牌导航意图。</li>\n<li>长度已足够长的 query。长 query 通常已包含充分约束，扩写收益低而漂移风险高。</li>\n<li>已被判定为高商业价值且稳定的 query（头部 query）。对这些 query 保持原样是稳妥选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多路召回的合并与去重\">多路召回的合并与去重</h2><p>改写产生的是<strong>一个查询集合</strong>而不是替代查询。工程上正确的执行方式是<strong>多路召回</strong>：原 query 一路、每个扩展词一路，各路独立检索后在合并阶段去重与融合。</p>\n<p>融合的排序需要区分两件事：原 query 命中的商品应当比扩展词命中的商品有更高优先级（原 query 匹配更精确），但扩展词命中的商品如果在多路中都出现，则应当被加权。这可以用一个简单的加权倒排融合实现：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>rel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>orig</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>expand</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(d) = \\sum_{q_i \\in Q&#x27;} w_i \\cdot \\text{rel}(d, q_i), \\quad w_{\\text{orig}} &gt; w_{\\text{expand}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">orig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expand</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可以按扩展类型与置信度设置，也可以按该扩展词的历史转化率自适应调整——后者更贴近业务目标，但需要防止过拟合到短期波动。</p>\n<p>去重的粒度通常是商品 ID 级别，但在跨市场场景下还要注意<strong>同一 SPU 的不同 SKU 是否算重复</strong>——这是商品目录侧对商品粒度与变体关系的定义问题，query 侧只需保证去重键与目录侧的定义一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>改写与纠错的边界是「说错」vs「说得不够」，二者判据不同必须分模块。</li>\n<li>改写的形式化目标是「在意图漂移受约束的前提下最大化召回」，没有约束项的系统会退化成「扩成热门词」。</li>\n<li>四类动作风险递增：补全、同义替换、概念扩展、属性补全；越靠后越应只在召回不足时触发。</li>\n<li>补全的信号来自点击共现，必须防范自我强化的反馈回路，用探索流量与时间衰减保持无偏。</li>\n<li>同义替换与概念扩展走「词典 → 向量 → 规则」级联，向量候选必须用类目一致性与共现统计二次过滤。</li>\n<li>改写由召回不足、会话改写行为、高置信意图与类目三类信号触发；型号词、裸品牌、长 query、头部 query 禁止改写。</li>\n<li>执行方式是多路召回加加权融合，不是替换查询。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同义词扩展在跨境场景下的漂移风险需要专门的护栏，见 <a href=\"synonym-expansion-guard\">同义词扩展的收益与漂移护栏</a>；改写不足导致的零结果由 <a href=\"../zero-result-longtail/zero-result-recovery\">零结果召回放宽与建议</a> 分层兜底。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询改写、补全与扩展","id":"查询改写-补全与扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：改写是在查询空间里的受约束搜索","id":"核心概念-改写是在查询空间里的受约束搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"补全：从点击共现里学「用户真正想要什么」","id":"补全-从点击共现里学-用户真正想要什么"},{"level":2,"text":"同义替换与概念扩展：词典、向量与规则","id":"同义替换与概念扩展-词典-向量与规则"},{"level":2,"text":"触发条件：什么时候不该改写","id":"触发条件-什么时候不该改写"},{"level":2,"text":"多路召回的合并与去重","id":"多路召回的合并与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拼写纠错（词典+模型）与置信度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecommerce-query-understanding/spelling-rewrite/spell-correction"},"next":{"title":"同义词扩展的收益与漂移护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecommerce-query-understanding/spelling-rewrite/synonym-expansion-guard"}}